            <ArticleTitle>[Ionic conjugates of sulfate carboxymethyl cellulose with dialkylaminomethyl derivatives of 2-isobornyl-4-methylphenol: synthesis and study of anti-inflammatory and analgesic activity].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>729-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Water-soluble sulfate polysalts of carboxymethyl cellulose and tertiary aminomethyl derivatives of 2-isobornyl-4-methylphenol was obtained. For the synthesized conjugates investigated in vivo anti-inflammatory activity in the test of acute formalin inflammation and analgesic activity in tests the &quot;hot plate&quot; and &quot;vinegar cramps&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
